  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "ieee80211: extend RSNXE to 4 octets and add EPPKE",
  "description": "This changeset adds dissection for Enhanced Client Privacy using the EPPKE protocol, based on 802.11bi D4.0. Tested between an AP in WPA3-Personal Transition Mode also configured to support EPPKE. Attached a pcap showing beacon, probe request and response, the three EPPKE authentication frames, and then the encrypted association request and response. [eppke-full-seq.pcap.gz](/uploads/ae095487d59a3c284bc63da621cc3973/eppke-full-seq.pcap.gz)",
